type: software
title: "Ushairi: Acoustic verification scripts for The Procrustean Bed"
abstract: "Python scripts (Praat/Parselmouth) that reproduce, line by line, the 34 acoustic figures of Chapter 9 of The Procrustean Bed, from formal readings of classical and contemporary Swahili poetry."
